    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6297" root="جمس" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَسَ</span></b> , (A, Msb, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمُسَ</span></b> , (Msb, TA,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُمُوسٌ</span> (S, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمْسٌ</span>; (TA;)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمُسَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمُسَ</span></b> ; (TA;) <i>It</i> (grease, As, S, A,
Msb, K, and clarified butter, and water, A, K,
but <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَدَ</span> is more commonly said of the last, K,
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَسَ</span> is incorrect when said of water, As, TA)
<i>congealed.</i> (As, S, A, Msb, K.)

